{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118380","id":3514119109,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7RdTPF","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118380","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118380.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118380.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118380","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118380/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118380/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118380/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/e2dc2dabe468cbcefb4985ed18dfff43cf1e7079","number":118380,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Fix ObjectDB snapshot breaking with multiple debug instances","user":{"login":"Infiland","id":88491175,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg4NDkxMTc1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/88491175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infiland","html_url":"https://github.com/Infiland","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infiland/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infiland/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infiland/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infiland/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infiland/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infiland/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infiland/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infiland/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infiland/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes #118325.\r\n\r\n## Summary\r\n\r\n- `ObjectDBProfilerPanel` used the global \"current\" debugger for all communication, causing snapshot requests to go to the wrong debugger when multiple instances are running\r\n- The plugin stored a single panel pointer overwritten on each `setup_session()` call, so only the last session's panel received messages\r\n- `set_enabled(false)` (called on session stop) did not reset snapshot state, leaving the button permanently stuck\r\n\r\n## Changes\r\n\r\n- Each `ObjectDBProfilerPanel` now stores a `Ref<EditorDebuggerSession>` passed via `set_session()` and uses it for all `send_message()`, `is_breaked()`, and signal connections\r\n- `ObjectDBProfilerDebuggerPlugin` tracks panels per session in a `HashMap<int, ObjectDBProfilerPanel *>` instead of a single pointer, and routes `capture()` messages to the correct panel by session ID\r\n- `set_enabled(false)` now resets `awaiting_debug_break`, `requested_break_for_snapshot`, and clears `partial_snapshots` so the button recovers if a session ends mid-snapshot\r\n- Removed the global debugger \"breaked\" signal connection from the constructor; the session's \"breaked\" signal is connected in `set_session()` instead\r\n- Changed `_on_debug_breaked` signature to match `EditorDebuggerSession::breaked` (which already filters `p_really_did`)\r\n- Follows the same per-session pattern used by `MultiplayerEditorDebugger`","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","de